// Cloudflare Pages Function for the home page ("/" only: see _routes.json, written by build.py).
//
// Moves the red dot on the hero map to the visitor's prefecture, estimated by
// Cloudflare from the IP address (request.cf). Nothing is stored or logged, and
// no JavaScript is sent to the browser. Visitors outside Japan, unknown
// locations, and any error all get the page as built: the dot on Tokyo.
//
// The page differs per visitor, so it must never be cached for someone else.

